  /* Below this the prompt and five links stop sharing a line, so the links drop
     underneath and align left with it rather than staying ragged on the right.
     Five short labels wrap onto two tidy rows — a drawer would add a button,
     focus trapping and JS to hide navigation that already fits.
     Wrapped, the bar is ~137px. Sticky, that would eat a sixth of a phone screen
